Package: asg4nbashots
Title: NBA Shot Data 1997–2020 Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mohammad Zulkifli", "Falaqi", , "mfal0012@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides cleaned and extended NBA shot-level data from
    1997–2020, including shot type, distance, court zones, outcomes, and
    season context.  The package also includes a Shiny app for interactive
    exploration and visualisation of trends in shot selection and
    efficiency.  Inspired by the Stand-up Maths video “We analysed
    4,678,387 NBA shots” (YouTube, 2020), using publicly available NBA
    shot data hosted on data.world/sportsvizsunday. Differences in total
    observations (~4.7M vs 4.68M cited in the video) likely reflect source
    compilation or filtering.
